OL,3,GNEWSA'Taxi hit-and-run' and 'Christmas
OL,4,Ashoppers deserve better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FA young mother suffered a fractured
OL,11,Fknee after being hit by a taxi driver
OL,12,Fin a hit-and-run in north Bristol,
OL,13,Faccording to Bristol Live.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, in Gloucester, a councillor
OL,16,Fhas called for urgent action to repair
OL,17,Fa shopping centre, as stuck windows
OL,18,Fleft partly opened caused a "safety
OL,19,Fhazard". Councillor Rebecca Trimnell
OL,20,Fdeclared Christmas shoppers deserve
OL,21,Fbetter.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
