OL,3,GNEWSA'Taxi hit-and-run' and 'Christmas
OL,4,Ashoppers deserve better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd a new stretch of canal at
OL,7,FWichelstowe, on the outskirts of
OL,8,FSwindon, has been completed. Swindon
OL,9,FBorough Council says the 600m canal
OL,10,Fwill now naturally fill with rainwater.
OL,11,FIt's part of the next phase of the
OL,12,Frestoration of the Wiltshire and
OL,13,FBerkshire Canal.
